{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>TVB《模範律師團》早前完成深圳取景後，已回到香港繼續進行剩餘的拍攝任務。近日，不少網民在赤柱、中環及銅鑼灣等地野生捕獲劇組開工，紛紛大讚視后楊茜堯、視帝羅嘉良（撈家）及陳煒（煒哥）保養得宜且氣場強勁，令劇迷期待值大增。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_67535ff098854275-362\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從現場直擊可見，男主角羅嘉良以相當搶眼的白髮造型現身，身穿經典深色條紋三件頭西裝並配戴黑超，盡顯熟男紳士魅力。楊茜堯則以一身啡色西裝套裝上陣，與陳煒的灰色設計感上衣互相輝映，兩位女主角均完美展現出自信且具魅力的職場女性風範。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_67535ff098854275-362\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8ce193d8-d7f9-4f57-9355-d825d554d387.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026rixQGmXBpu1786350413.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8ce193d8-d7f9-4f57-9355-d825d554d387.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0a1fc6bf-f468-45ae-add0-24d5a32b5ffb.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Wv5hggAWzD1786350413.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0a1fc6bf-f468-45ae-add0-24d5a32b5ffb.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_67535ff098854275-362\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_67535ff098854275-363\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>有親臨現場目睹拍攝過程的網民在社交平台發文，大讚劇組認真細致的幕後細節：「看著演員們一遍遍補妝、走位、對詞，哪怕只是最終播出時幾秒鐘的鏡頭，現場都反覆拍攝了好多次！親眼看到才深刻懂得，那些幾十分鐘的劇集背後，究竟藏著多少人的認真與付出。」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T08:39:16.881948+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":343,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}